          "en": "Every one of these four was found by asking \"what work does this do more often than it needs to?\" — the CSV was parsed on the UI thread, the aggregate was recomputed per request, the list grew without bound, and a bulk insert was treated as a loop. None of them was found by profiling a method in isolation. Appendix E turns the same question into a test plan.",
